## Prepare a release

Build and package the app first. Review the official Sparkle tool path before allowing it to access the EdDSA key in Keychain:

```bash
sparklekit prepare-release "/path/to/{{APP_NAME}}-VERSION.zip" \
  --project "$(pwd)" \
  --version VERSION \
  --release-mode {{RELEASE_MODE}} \
  --notes "release-notes/next.md" \
  --generate-appcast "/path/to/Sparkle/bin/generate_appcast"
```

If the reviewed helper is located inside this project, add `--allow-project-execution`. A completely unsigned app is blocked during preparation unless the deliberate `--allow-unsigned` exception is supplied and recorded.

Preview publication without network writes:

```bash
sparklekit publish preview ".sparklekit/releases/vVERSION"
```

